     A*****************************************************************
     A* SCRIPTURA DATA WORK FILE FOR POLICY PAGES - PAYROLL/PREMIUM   *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*                                                               *
     A*  PROJECT:  SY371        PROGRAMMER:  C:65                     *
     A*  CREATED:  02/22/16                                           *
     A*  DESCRIPTION:  THIS IS THE WORK FILE TO HOLD THE DATA FOR     *
     A*                POLICY PAGE SCHEDULE OF OPERATIONS - PAYROLL   *
     A*                AND PREMIUM DATA.                              *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                TYPES OF LINE ITEMS:                           *
     A*                ' ' - RECORD FOR STATE PAGE OR SUMMARY PAGE.   *
     A*                      CONTAINS EXPERIENCE MOD INFO.            *
     A*                'E' - PAYROLL DATA.                            *
     A*                'P' - PREMIUM DATA.                            *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 07/12/23 C:65  PROJECT: 153WAH                                *
     A*                ADD TWO MORE EXPERIENCE MODIFIER STATUSES.     *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 06/01/23 C:291 PROJECT: 153WAH                                *
     A*                ADD EXPERIENCE MODIFIER STATUS                 *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 05/20/19 C:180 PROJECT WC2667                                 *
     A*                ADD ARP FIELDS                                 *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 04/30/18 C:136 SUPPORT: 70391                                 *
     A*                ADD CAREWEST TERRITORY RATING FIELDS TO        *
     A*                SCRIPTURA OUTPUT                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 02/08/18 C:65  PROJECT: 148WAT                                *
     A*                ADD FLAG FOR ASSESSMENT LINE ITEMS AS WELL AS  *
     A*                ANNUAL/PRORATED PREMIUM AND TOTAL AMOUNTS.     *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 11/07/17 C:65  PROJECT: 148WAN                                *
     A*                ADD STATE NAMES.                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 08/16/17 C:65  PROJECT: 150WAO                                *
