     A*                ADD FIELDS FOR TERRORISM BREAKOUT SECTION.     *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 07/27/17 C:62  PROJECT: 150WAL                                *
     A*                ADD TERRITORIAL DIFFERENTITAL FACTOR           *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 12/16/16 C:65  PROJECT: SY371                                 *
     A*                ADD PERCENTAGE AND FACTOR FIELDS FOR PREMIUM   *
     A*                LINE ITEMS - VALUES REMOVED FROM HEADING.      *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 06/20/16 C:65  PROJECT: SY371                                 *
